# Agent-emitted artifacts (research/plan/spec markdown rendered by
# emit_* tools). In Docker e2e/smoke runs these land in the
# agentic-artifacts named volume; out-of-Docker local-dev runs use
# CWD-relative .artifacts/ defaults (see cmd/semteams/tools/emit*).
# Either path keeps the host checkout clean of generated content.
.artifacts/

# Run-time-derived flow configs for e2e journeys (e.g. the autonomous-mode
# clarification-policy journey derives e2e-flow-bootstrap-autonomous.gen.json
# from e2e-flow-bootstrap.json via jq, then removes it on teardown). Never
# committed — always derived from the canonical config to avoid drift.
configs/*.gen.json

# ADR-043 PR 4.5 F6 — per-tenant devcontainer workspaces. Bound into
# the sandbox container at the same absolute path so DooD-spawned
# sibling containers see the workspace on the host docker daemon.
# Default is ui/.tenant-workspaces/ (set by ui/Taskfile.yml's
# stack:up); operator-set SEMTEAMS_TENANT_ROOT overrides.
.tenant-workspaces/

# Legacy emit-tool output dirs (pre-ADR-041 default was docs/X).
# Ignored to prevent further leaks; existing committed files are
# being deleted alongside the default switch.
/docs/specs/
/docs/research/
/docs/plans/
